OL,3,GNEWSATrams will need to cope with 50B0C
OL,4,Aheat, says mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of South Yorkshire says the
OL,7,Fcity's Supertram network is being
OL,8,Frenewed so it can withstand
OL,9,Ftemperatures of up to 50B0C amid
OL,10,Fconcerns over escalating climate
OL,11,Fchange.
OL,13,FOliver Coppard has spoken about trams,
OL,14,Ftrains, plans for a controversial solar
OL,15,Ffarm and whether it was appropriate for
OL,16,Fthe government to sound the emergency
OL,17,Fsiren over barbecues.
OL,19,FThe Labour mayor has been answering
OL,20,Fquestions on BBC Radio Sheffield's
OL,21,Fphone-in Call Coppard.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
