OL,4,Aheat, says mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn his recent experiences of the
OL,7,Fheatwaves, Coppard says: "I was outside
OL,8,FDoncaster railway station doing an
OL,9,Fevent when the emergency siren went off
OL,10,F[to alert people about the dangers of
OL,11,Fwildfires].
